    <details><summary>How many levels are in Arrows Puzzle Escape?</summary><p>The official listing says "thousands of handcrafted levels," and that checks out: the v0.23.1 package we inspected ships with 3,983 campaign boards (plus rotating daily challenges on top). The developer keeps extending the count through updates, so any exact figure online is a snapshot — but thousands is real, not marketing.</p></details>

